{
  "uid": "pca-progress",
  "title": "Meu progresso PCA",
  "tags": [
    "pca",
    "progress"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Meu progresso PCA",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Estudando Prometheus com Prometheus.** Estes números vêm do seu `challenges/.progress.json` (desafios) e de `challenges/.exam-results.json` (simulado), expostos por `./check.py exporter` (porta **9199**) e raspados pelo job `pca-progress` deste Prometheus.\n\nPainéis vazios? Rode em `challenges/`: `./check.py exporter` (ou `./check.py exporter --docker` se o firewall do host bloquear containers → host). Resolva desafios com `./check.py list` / `./check.py 001 '<query>'`. Todas as queries deste dashboard são PromQL de verdade: abra o painel e estude-as também."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Exporter de progresso",
      "description": "`up{job=\"pca-progress\"}`: 1 quando o Prometheus consegue raspar o `./check.py exporter`.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(up{job=\"pca-progress\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "exporter",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "parado",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "no ar",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
